  "figshare_url": "https://springernature.figshare.com/articles/dataset/MyoKi_A_database_of_multimodal_myography_and_hand_kinematics_during_realistic_daily_life_activities/28696778",
  "download_disabled": false,
  "description": "The MyoKi databse contains data from 35 participants performing 74 different tasks, each repeated 6 times. Each participant's data contains 12-channel EMG, 9-channel IMU (each channel with 3-axis accelerometer and 3-axis gyroscope) distributed across the right arm, and joint angles of 18 finger and wrist joints. Additional 24-channel FMG data was acquired for participants P26 to P35. A detailed file structure is available in the data descriptor.",
